      "title": "Scope",
      "content": "Scope: This Indian Standard (IS 374 : 2026) covers and specifies requirements for Electric Ceiling Fans - Specification (Fifth Revision - Energy Star Mandatory). It applies to electric_ceiling_fans under fans category in the electrical domain.",
